{
  "id": "668",
  "title": "Money Isn’t Everything",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-05-11",
  "synopsis": "Can everything in life be bought if you have enough money?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1042/379132600f29b9479dacc8553067deb3fd9559b2.mp3?1557145854",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "钱不是万能的\n\n保罗：我觉得钱是万能的。有钱就可以得到一切。\n小乐：你错了！钱不是万能的。有钱不一定可以得到一切。你看马云，很有钱吧？\n保罗：嗯。\n小乐：他到现在都没有得到我的微信，但是你有，所以你要珍惜。\n保罗：……",
    "traditional": "錢不是萬能的\n\n保羅：我覺得錢是萬能的。有錢就可以得到一切。\n小樂：你錯了！錢不是萬能的。有錢不一定可以得到一切。你看馬雲，很有錢吧？\n保羅：嗯。\n小樂：他到現在都沒有得到我的微信，但是你有，所以你要珍惜。\n保羅：……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Money Isn’t Everything"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：我觉得钱是万能的。有钱就可以得到一切。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我覺得錢是萬能的。有錢就可以得到一切。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ jué de qián shì wàn néng de yǒu qián jiù kě yǐ dé dào yí qiè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I think money is everything. If you have money, you can obtain everything."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：你错了！钱不是万能的。有钱不一定可以得到一切。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你錯了！錢不是萬能的。有錢不一定可以得到一切。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ cuò le qián bú shì wàn néng de yǒu qián bù yí dìng kě yǐ dé dào yí qiè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "你看马云，很有钱吧？",
      "traditional": "你看馬雲，很有錢吧？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn mǎ yún hěn yǒu qián ba",
      "english": "Little Le: You’re wrong! Money isn’t everything. It’s not certain that you can get everything with money."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Look at Jack Ma. He’s got a lot of money, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "保罗：嗯。",
      "traditional": "保羅：嗯。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó èn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yeah."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小乐：他到现在都没有得到我的微信，但是你有，所以你要珍惜。",
      "traditional": "小樂：他到現在都沒有得到我的微信，但是你有，所以你要珍惜。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tā dào xiàn zài dōu méi yǒu dé dào wǒ de wēi xìn dàn shì nǐ yǒu suǒ yǐ nǐ yào zhēn xī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Until now, he still doesn’t have me on WeChat, but you do. So you should cherish that."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "保罗：……",
      "traditional": "保羅：……",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
